implementationPlan.description:
Add `useDryRun` mutation hook to `dashboard/src/hooks/useWorkflows.ts`.

Interface:
```ts
interface DryRunResult {
  steps: Array<{ step_id: string; step_type: string; decision: string; reason: string; rule_id?: string }>;
}
```

Mutation: `post<DryRunResult>(`/workflows/${workflowId}/dry-run`, { input, environment })`. Returns typed result.

SECURITY: Uses authenticated API client. Input is the same validated form data from RunNowModal.
